3. gautamkrishnar/keepalive-workflow (GitHub Action) — NO LONGER USED
----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Source:    https://github.com/marketplace/actions/keepalive-workflow
  License:   MIT
  Use:       formerly a workflow step in .github/workflows/renew.yml, which
             kept scheduled workflows from being auto-disabled by GitHub
             after 60 days of repository inactivity.
  Status:    Removed. The upstream action was blocked by GitHub for ToS
             reasons in 2025-04 (the marketplace repository no longer exists,
             the job fails at "Set up job" with "Repository access blocked").
             This project now implements the same behaviour as a
             self-contained job inside renew.yml, with zero third-party
             dependencies. Listed here as a historical record only.

