5. Zhihu publish flow (community reference implementations)
 ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Source:    zimya/zhihu_obsidian  — https://github.com/zimya/zhihu_obsidian
              License: 0BSD
              Copyright (C) 2026 by zimya.
              wechatsync/Wechatsync  — https://github.com/wechatsync/Wechatsync
              License: GPL-3.0 (consulted for API shape; not linked)
   Use:       The Zhihu column publish flow in src/zhihu.rs — the four web
              endpoints (create draft -> PATCH draft content -> attach topic
              -> content/publish), the required headers (Cookie + x-xsrftoken
              + x-requested-with: fetch), and the topic-autocomplete matching
              were modelled on these tools' publicly-documented HTTP approach.
              Notably the write endpoints do NOT require x-zse-96 signing.
   Statement: Protocol/flow reference only; no source code copied. The Rust
              implementation (src/zhihu.rs) is independent.

