 6. socialsbase/devto-api (crate devto-api) — inlined into src/devto.rs
 ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Source:    https://github.com/socialsbase/devto-api
              (crates.io package: devto-api, v0.1.0; also MIT per its README)
   License:   MIT
   Copyright: Copyright (c) 2025 socialsbase
   Contract:  Generated from the Forem API v1 OpenAPI specification
              https://developers.forem.com/api

   Use:       src/devto.rs — the dev.to (Forem) publishing channel — is a
              condensed inline derivation of this SDK. Retained / adapted:
                * base URL constant https://dev.to/api (its DEVTO_API_URL)
                * the "api-key" authentication request header
                * the shape of POST /api/articles (operationId createArticle)
                * status handling for 201 / 401 / 422
                * the field set of its generated types Article / ArticleArticle
                  (re-shaped here as CreateArticle / ArticleBody)
              Deliberately dropped: the Progenitor build-time code generator
              (generated body: 8,142 lines), the async/Tokio runtime, and 60+
              unused endpoints (comments, billboards, pages, organizations, ...).
              The implementation runs on this project's existing blocking
              reqwest stack instead of introducing a second runtime.

